    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner \u2013 the ultimate cannabis business simulation where you build, manage, and expand your very own weed shop empire in the heart of Amsterdam! \ud83c\udf0d\ud83d\udc9a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the vibrant world of legalised cannabis culture and take on the role of an ambitious entrepreneur determined to dominate the green scene. Whether you're a strategic tycoon or a chill shopkeeper, <strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner</strong> offers a high-stakes blend of business management, customisation, and lifestyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Start Small, Grow Big \u2013 Open a humble shop, stock up on premium strains, edibles, and accessories, and build your reputation in the booming cannabis industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Customise Your Store \u2013 Arrange shelves, decorate with neon signs and chill furniture, and create the perfect atmosphere for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Hire &amp; Manage Staff \u2013 Bring in employees to handle sales, keep the shop clean, and provide security. Train your team to maximise efficiency and profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeac Experience the Lifestyle \u2013 Take a break and enjoy your own products\u2014but be careful, getting too high on the job might make things\u2026 hazy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Expand Across the City \u2013 Open new locations, and cater to a growing customer base. Unlock new products and new locations in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Build Your Empire \u2013 Set your prices, manage expenses, and keep up with demand to rake in the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner</strong>, success is in your hands. Roll up, stock up, and take your weed shop to the top! \ud83c\udf3f\ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner \u2013 the ultimate cannabis business simulation where you build, manage, and expand your very own weed shop empire in the heart of Amsterdam! \ud83c\udf0d\ud83d\udc9a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the vibrant world of legalised cannabis culture and take on the role of an ambitious entrepreneur determined to dominate the green scene. Whether you're a strategic tycoon or a chill shopkeeper, <strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner</strong> offers a high-stakes blend of business management, customisation, and lifestyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Start Small, Grow Big \u2013 Open a humble shop, stock up on premium strains, edibles, and accessories, and build your reputation in the booming cannabis industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Customise Your Store \u2013 Arrange shelves, decorate with neon signs and chill furniture, and create the perfect atmosphere for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Hire &amp; Manage Staff \u2013 Bring in employees to handle sales, keep the shop clean, and provide security. Train your team to maximise efficiency and profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeac Experience the Lifestyle \u2013 Take a break and enjoy your own products\u2014but be careful, getting too high on the job might make things\u2026 hazy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Expand Across the City \u2013 Open new locations, and cater to a growing customer base. Unlock new products and new locations in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Build Your Empire \u2013 Set your prices, manage expenses, and keep up with demand to rake in the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner</strong>, success is in your hands. Roll up, stock up, and take your weed shop to the top! \ud83c\udf3f\ud83d\udd25</p>",
